# Agent rules — `__AOH_MODULE_NAME__` module

Module-level agent context. Sub-packages have their own `AGENTS.md`
with package-specific rules; consult them when working inside a
specific sub-package.

## Cross-package invariants

* **Wire contract**: changes to `service/internal/dto/*.go` MUST be
  mirrored in `types/src/index.ts` in the same PR. The `client/`
  integration tests catch drift.
* **One-way dependency chain**: `web → client → types → service`. Do
  not introduce a back-edge. The service must remain consumable from
  any TS context; the SDK is the topmost layer.
* **Workspace pinning**: `client/` depends on `types/` via
  `workspace:*`. `web/` depends on `client/` via `workspace:*`. Do not
  pin to a specific version inside this module — pnpm resolves these
  at install time.

## Scope

This module is part of the **ops-hub platform-monorepo**. See
`aoh-conventions/references/project.md` for the broader monorepo
shape and how this module fits.
